{\b\fs24 Welcome to XProtect Prepare Win}\par
\par
This tool prepares a Windows machine for a Milestone XProtect installation, according to field-proven best practice.\par
\par
{\b How it works}\par
\bullet  Checks first, fixes only what is needed\par
\bullet  Every item reports "Already done" or "Corrected now"\par
\bullet  Safe to re-run any time \endash  after Windows updates, or just to verify\par
\bullet  Everything is logged (with a registry backup) to C:\\Milestonecheck-ulfh\par
